Creating Core System Configuration Files

1. Set up system hostname and hosts file:

`echo "klfs" > /etc/hostname`

`cat << 'EOF' > /etc/hosts`
`127.0.0.1 localhost`
`127.0.1.1 klfs`
`EOF`

Setting Up the Build Directory for Source Code

1. Create a dedicated sources directory and build workspace inside the chroot:

`mkdir -pv /sources`
`chmod -v a+wt /sources`

2. Set environment variables to keep build directories organized:

`export SRC=/sources`
`cd $SRC`

3. Verify the source workspace directory:

`ls -ld /sources`
